<h2><%= raceEmoji %> <%= playerName %> of <%= raceLabel %> Ancestry</h2>
<p><%- raceBackstory %></p>
<p><%- raceTraits %></p>

<h2>Inventory & Stats</h2>
<p>
    You are wielding the <%= weaponEmoji %> <%= weaponName %> granting <span class="hp"><%= attackPower %> Physical Attack</span><% if (weaponCrit > 0) { %> and <span class="crit">+<%= weaponCrit %>% Critical Hit Chance</span><% } %>, and wearing the <%= armorEmoji %> <%= armorName %> providing <span class="muted"><%= defensePower %> Physical Defense</span><% if (armorRegen > 0) { %> and <span class="heal">+<%= armorRegen %> HP Regeneration</span><% } %>.
</p>
<p>
    Combined with your ancestry, you strike with a total of <span class="crit"><%= totalCrit %>% Critical Hit Chance</span> and mend wounds at <span class="heal">+<%= totalRegen %> HP Regeneration</span> per rest cycle, while navigating the roads with a <span class="muted"><%= ambushChance %>% Ambush Risk</span>.
</p>

<h2>The Journey So Far</h2>
<p>
    Your journey across the realm has been defined by conflict and survival. You have fought through <span class="gold"><%= battlesGroup %></span>, slaying <span class="gold"><%= opponentRaceGroup %></span> and overcoming <span class="hp"><%= ambushesGroup %></span> along the road.
</p>
<p>
    Experience wise, you are at <span class="gold">Level <%= level %></span> with <span class="xp"><%= totalXpFormatted %> Total XP</span><% if (!isMaxLevel) { %>, requiring another <span class="xp"><%= xpNeededFormatted %> XP</span> to reach <span class="gold">Level <%= nextLevel %></span><% } else { %>, standing unchallenged at the zenith of martial prowess<% } %> and your vitality currently sustains you at <span class="hp"><%= hpFormatted %> / <%= maxHpFormatted %> HP</span> while your purse holds <span class="gold">🪙 <%= adenaFormatted %> Adena</span> for the journey ahead.
</p>

<p class="last">
    <a href="/">Continue your journey</a>
</p>
